  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the responsiveness, accountability and community engagement of the Somali Police in fragile and newly recovered areas-SENRA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support the expansion of people-centric policing services in 6 NRAs, selected in line with government and state stabilisation priorities. This will be achieved by supporting and enabling community engagement with the local police, including Darwish, to develop inclusive local police plans for security and stability in the communities. The government and UN support will require coordination and integration of local voices and participation across 6 target locations which will re</narrative>
  </description>
